      "message": "I made a quick patch to try this out, but I don\u0027t have a good test case for aarch64, so please see if this works for you: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/crosvm/crosvm/+/4035738",
      "parentUuid": "644c4a28_6f339dd4",
